    "https://franklincollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Job-Elmon-and-Lucile-Williams-Endowed-Chair-in-Law-and-Public-Service-TT-Political-Science-2026.pdf": {
      "title": "Elmon and Lucile Williams Endowed Chair in Law and Public Service – Assistant Professor of Political Science – Tenure Track",
